        "original_id": "fb9125e6-8d26-5f4d-9d94-f71567c93cef",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Charles R. Black Jr., Paul Manafort, Donald Trump Jr., Jared Kushner, Natalia Veselnitskaya, Peter G. Kelly, John F. Scruggs, James Healey\n- Organizations: Prime Policy Group, Burson-Marsteller Global Public Relations, BKSH & Associates Worldwide, Timmons & Company, Trump presidential campaign\n- Places: Washington, D.C., Trump Tower, New York City\n- Events: Trump campaign–Russian meeting\n\nFacts:\n- Charles R. Black Jr. was born in 1947.\n- Paul Manafort was born on April 1, 1949.\n- Paul Manafort is an American lawyer, lobbyist, and political consultant.\n- Charles R. Black Jr. is the current Chairman of Prime Policy Group.\n- Prime Policy Group is a public affairs firm and a subsidiary of Burson-Marsteller Global Public Relations.\n- BKSH & Associates, also called Black, Kelly, Scruggs & Healey, was a Washington, D.C.-based lobbying firm whose principals included Charles R. Black Jr., Peter G. Kelly, John F. Scruggs, and James Healey.\n- In 2010, BKSH & Associates merged with Timmons & Company to form Prime Policy Group.\n- On June 9, 2016, a meeting was held in Trump Tower in New York City between Donald Trump Jr., Jared Kushner, Paul Manafort, and at least five other people including Natalia Veselnitskaya.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
